{
  "title": "Nourishing Juicy Canadian Beef Bowl",
  "description": "A hearty Canadian dish featuring tender feather blade beef, perfect for a hangover cure, served in a hot dolsot stone bowl. This peppery and juicy bowl is a flexitarian friendly option.",
  "cuisine": "Canadian",
  "diet": [
    "flexitarian"
